sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as attached vital code
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant TM as Track Model
    Note over W,V: Within a scan (UC-09), after the program has set SW_s.
    W->>V: SW_s, SWREV_s, OCC_b, CTCCMD_s, HAND_s
    V->>V: request := CTC command, else hand-set, else program
    V->>V: OUT_SW_s := actual position if the block is occupied, else the request
    V->>V: moving := OUT_SW_s differs from SWREV_s, so OUT_AUTH_b := 0
    V-->>W: OUT_SW_s
    W->>W: OS encode: 1 is reverse, 0 normal
    W-->>M: switches
    M-->>H: switch_commands (line, block): normal or reverse
    H->>TM: switch command
    TM-->>H: actual position, next tick (UC-12)
